<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3287 0 R
/E (THE PRAYER SPOKE -- Prayer is the natural response to God as we hear Him speak through His Word. It is sharing our heart with the One who longs for our companionship and who cares about our concerns. Prayer not only trains our hearts and minds to know the power and glory of God, but also turns His ear towards action in our lives and of those who we pray for \(John 15:7, Philippians 4:6-7\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
