978 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3288 0 R
/E (THE FELLOWSHIP SPOKE -- God has directed Christians to build each other up through inter-dependence and loving relationships with each other \(Hebrews 10:24-25\). Gathering as the Body of Christ draws God close around us as we praise Him and encourage one another \(Matthew 18:20\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [11]
>>
