/T (The Bible does not need to be intimidating! The Bible is a collection of 66 books written over the course of 2,000 years, across three continents in three different languages, all telling one unified story of the God of the universe saving His people. Over time, Bible translators have added chapters and verses to help readers navigate around the Bible easier.)
/E (The Bible does not need to be intimidating! The Bible is a collection of 66 books written over the course of 2,000 years, across three continents in three different languages, all telling one unified story of the God of the universe saving His people. Over time, Bible translators have added chapters and verses to help readers navigate around the Bible easier.)
