1115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Prayer can be intimidating when you first start: knowing what to say and how to approach God. At its core, prayer is just talking and listening to God - there are no magic words or postures necessary. This A.C.T.S. tool is not the only way to pray, but is a simple tool to develop the discipline and delight of prayer. There is no set time for each aspect, but as you grow in prayer don't be surprised if you find yourself spending more and more time doing it. )
/E (Prayer can be intimidating when you first start: knowing what to say and how to approach God. At its core, prayer is just talking and listening to God - there are no magic words or postures necessary. This A.C.T.S. tool is not the only way to pray, but is a simple tool to develop the discipline and delight of prayer. There is no set time for each aspect, but as you grow in prayer don't be surprised if you find yourself spending more and more time doing it. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
