/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (A testimony is the story of how Jesus saved you and why the gospel is good news for you personally. Our individual stories are some of the most powerful discipleship and evangelism tools because they are so deeply unique to us, yet can be relatable to others! As you begin to work on this, ask the Lord for wisdom and insight into just how to share your unique story. After completing the three sections, put them together into one cohesive,  3-5 minute long story. Then practice sharing your stories together!)
