1424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (Jesus says in Mark 10:45, "Even the Son of man did not come to be served, but to serve, and to give his life as a ransom for many." In the verse before this, Jesus tells his disciples that in order to be first, they must be the "slave of all." Jesus not only spoke of serving others, but demonstrated through His own life what a servant looks like. Jesus modeled that serving others is something that must come out of our identity as who we are \(i.e. a servant\), not simply something we occasionally choose to do.  )
/E (Jesus says in Mark 10:45, "Even the Son of man did not come to be served, but to serve, and to give his life as a ransom for many." In the verse before this, Jesus tells his disciples that in order to be first, they must be the "slave of all." Jesus not only spoke of serving others, but demonstrated through His own life what a servant looks like. Jesus modeled that serving others is something that must come out of our identity as who we are \(i.e. a servant\), not simply something we occasionally choose to do.  )
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
