2022 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Begin your time settling your heart. This may involve going for a walk, journaling, praying \(silently, out loud as you walk, or with a friend\), singing hymns or reflecting on a Psalm. The goal of this time is to answer the question: How am I doing?)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
