<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After some time, it will likely be helpful to go to Scripture. Consider reading through an entire epistle, a section of scripture, or reviewing verses you have found meaningful. Prayerfully consider who the Lord is and what He might have to say to you through the time.)
