/S /H3
/T (Through doing good to our neighbor and fellow man we display the light of God to a dark and broken world. These good deeds not only give our Father glory, but are prepared beforehand by God for us to do! And while the merit of one's salvation is entirely based on the completed work of Christ's death and resurrection, we are instructed in James 2:14-26 to manifest our faith in Christ through our loving good deeds to those around us.)
/E (Through doing good to our neighbor and fellow man we display the light of God to a dark and broken world. These good deeds not only give our Father glory, but are prepared beforehand by God for us to do! And while the merit of one's salvation is entirely based on the completed work of Christ's death and resurrection, we are instructed in James 2:14-26 to manifest our faith in Christ through our loving good deeds to those around us.)
