2659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (What is a Sabbath? "It is a small yet ample chunk of space, a narrow yet full segment of time. In it you can lie down and rest. From it you can rise up and go -- stronger, lighter, ready to work again with vigor and a clear mind. It is room enough, time enough, in which to relinquish all encumbrances, to act as though their existence has nothing whatsoever to do with your own. It is an invitation, at one and the same time, to empty yourself and fill yourself." The Rest of God, Mark Buchanan.)
/E (What is a Sabbath? "It is a small yet ample chunk of space, a narrow yet full segment of time. In it you can lie down and rest. From it you can rise up and go -- stronger, lighter, ready to work again with vigor and a clear mind. It is room enough, time enough, in which to relinquish all encumbrances, to act as though their existence has nothing whatsoever to do with your own. It is an invitation, at one and the same time, to empty yourself and fill yourself." The Rest of God, Mark Buchanan.)
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
